<p>If you think you&#39;ve targeted by any fraudster or received suspicious emails , please contact us on <u>info@unionbankofindiauk.co.uk</u> or call us on +44 20 7332 4250.</p>

<p>&nbsp;</p>

<p>Please refer to our Customer Information page for more details on APP fraud.&nbsp;<a href="/customer-informations">Customer information&rsquo;s</a></p>

